    <item>
      <title>OPINION: Our children need more protection from the AI that is teaching them</title>
      <link>https://hechingerreport.org/opinion-our-children-need-more-protection-from-ai</link>
      <description>Source: The Hechinger Report — For 15 years, we let children carry cellphones into most of our classrooms. By the time states began ordering the phones out, a generation had spent its childhood inundated by screens. We had protected everything about the arrangement except for the children. Similarly, during the rise of the commercial internet, we wrote rules to protect […] The post OPINION: Our children need more protection from the AI that is teaching them appeared first on The Hechinger Report .</description>
